the target language is: prolog.

% The fixture of testing/test_conditional_negation.pl (language.md §17.1.5):
% a negation over a judgment that nobody made, a first-match table read with
% that judgment still open, and one decision for each subject.

the templates are:
    the principal use of *a good* is *a use*; judged.
    *a good* is an article.
    *a good* is described by heading *a heading*.
    *a good* is classified in heading *a heading*.
    the subheading of *a good* in heading *a heading* is *a code*.
    the subheading of *a good* is *a code*.
    the subheading in heading *a heading* for *a use* is *a code* under table uses.
    *a use* is a household use.

the knowledge base conditional negation includes:

a good is described by heading 24
    if the good is an article
    and a use is a household use
    and the principal use of the good is the use.

a good is described by heading 26
    if the good is an article.

% the residual heading: only when no other heading describes the good
a good is classified in heading 24
    if the good is described by heading 24.

a good is classified in heading 26
    if the good is described by heading 26
    and it is not the case that
        the good is described by heading 24.

the subheading of a good is a code
    if the good is classified in heading a heading
    and the subheading of the good in heading the heading is the code.

the subheading of a good in heading a heading is a code
    if the principal use of the good is a use
    and the subheading in heading the heading for the use is the code under table uses.

table use is a household use.
kitchen use is a household use.

the table uses is, with first match:
    row | heading | use                      | code
    u1  | 24      | table use or kitchen use | "24.10"
    u2  | 24      | any                      | "24.90"
    u3  | 26      | office use               | "26.10"
    u4  | 26      | ornament                 | "26.40"
    u5  | 26      | any                      | "26.90"

scenario open is:
    the box is an article.

scenario decided is:
    the box is an article.
    the principal use of the box is ornament, according to the officer.

scenario household is:
    the box is an article.
    the principal use of the box is kitchen use, according to the officer.

query subheading is:
    the subheading of the box is which code.
